id: super-majin-majin-mania
name: Majin Mania
order: 1
slot: trait
# (5) "select and gain access to an additional Majin Secondary Racial Trait while you possess this Awakening" - asked as it is gained, had
# while it applies (racial.mjs, Pure Form's Erratic Majin (3) way).
grantsRacialOf: majin
grantsRacialImportance: secondary
description: >
  You become a veritable juggernaut, allowing you to shake off damage and continue fighting long past when most would go down.
text: >
  Majin Mania: You become a veritable juggernaut, allowing you to shake off damage and continue fighting long past when most would go down.
  (1)-[Passive]: While you are at the Healthy Health Threshold, increase your Combat Rolls and Soak Value by 1(T).
  (2)-[Passive]: While you are below the Injured Health Threshold, increase your Surgency by 2(T).
  (3)-[Passive]: Ignore the 6th effect of the Rubbery Body Racial Trait.
  (4)-[Passive]: When you gain this Awakening, you may:
  • Change your base Size Category.
  • Gain any Factors (you must still exchange Racial Traits as usual for their Factor Traits).
  • Exchange any number of your Secondary Racial Traits for any other Majin Secondary Racial Traits.
  • Lose access to any number of Signature Techniques and regain any Technique Points spent on them. Then, you may spend your Technique Points as you wish.
  (5)-[Passive]: Upon gaining this Awakening, select and gain access to an additional Majin Secondary Racial Trait while you possess this Awakening.
  (6)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If you get hit by an Attacking Maneuver, regain Life Points equal to your Surgency before calculating Damage.
  (7)-[Triggered/Start of Turn]: Regain Life Points equal to 1/4 (rounded up) of your Surgency.
  (8)-[Triggered/Defeated]: Use a Healing Surge as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver. If you do, double your Surgency for the duration of that Healing Surge.

---

# (1) In the Healthy Health Threshold: Combat Rolls and Soak Value 1(T).
[passive, effect 1]
if (!belowThreshold("bruised")) {
    combatRolls += 1(T);
    soakValue += 1(T);
}

# (2) Below the Injured Health Threshold: Surgency 2(T).
[passive, effect 2]
if (belowThreshold("injured")) {
    surgency += 2(T);
}

# (3) Rubbery Body (6)'s 5(bT) more Damage from a Direct or Lethal attack taken back - where Rubbery Body is had.
[passive, effect 3]
if (holdsTrait("rubbery-body")) {
    incoming.damage.directOrHigher -= 5(bT);
}

# (4) What may be changed as it is gained - the base Size Category, Factors, Secondary Racial Traits, Signature Techniques and their
# Technique Points: the table's, done by hand on the sheet (Settings, the Traits tab, Signature Techniques) as it is gained.
# (5) Its header's `grantsRacialOf`.

# (6) Hit by an Attacking Maneuver, once a Round: Life Points equal to your Surgency before the Damage - ticked in the window as you are hit.
[triggered/being-hit, 1/round, effect 6]
life.value += surgency;

# (7) The start of your turn: 1/4 (rounded up) of your Surgency in Life Points - its Triggered/Automatic button.
[triggered/start-of-turn, effect 7]
life.value += ceil(surgency / 4);

# (8) Defeated: a Healing Surge out of sequence, its Surgency doubled for it - chosen on the Defeated card, never Automatic.
[triggered/defeated, outOfSequence, effect 8]
surge(healing, 1, 0, 0, 2);
